  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Surveillance and Mitigation to combat AMR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims at providing concrete actionable data on antibiotic pollution and mitigation options related to Indian pharmaceutical production. It establishes the knowledge base for a collaborative platform that will bring together the Indian government, Indian research institutions, international academic institutions with capabilities for research and intervention in the area of AMR such as Aalborg University and Technical University of Denmark, ICARS (International Centre for Antimicrobial Resistance Solutions), select philanthropic foundations, and critical civil society organizations working in the area of AMR and environmental protection.</narrative>
  </description>
